   "translations": [
    {
     "language_code": "eng",
     "text": [
      "All glories to the infallible Lord, the husband of the goddess of fortune, the reservoir of all pleasure, and the moon of Vṛndāvana. All glories to He who holds a flute to His lips, whose complexion is like a beautiful dark blue rain cloud, and who is the bliss of the gopīs."
     ]
    }
   ],
